{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:03 2026-09-17 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:03 2026-09-17 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:03 2026-09-17 HKT</p><p>流浮山雞伯嶺路鳳降村一個貨倉，今日（17日）下午1時15分發生火警，火勢猛烈並冒出大量濃煙。消防接報到場撲救，至下午1時29分將火勢級別升為三級。據報現場貨倉面積約50米乘30米，最少25男1女疏散，​火警中暫未接獲受傷報告。</p><img alt=\"​ Threads圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/453ffabef63d2deaae9a7eaf16039329/2026-09/813765504_18127885591792420_3276074044553230610_n.jpg\"/><img alt=\"​ Threads圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8fae3ccbac4f019c09ce7ef82f494d9b/2026-09/813837177_18127885573792420_1711786208498473556_n.jpg\"/><img alt=\"​ Threads圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4698455e69853faece4983541ed6cbf5/2026-09/813322804_18127885678792420_4705542540147120156_n.jpg\"/><img alt=\"網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c19ea61c783495255f210de143751990/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-17_at_14_14_48_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aaad7ab9ad8fab6f299106b77defea0b/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-17_at_14_14_48.jpeg\"/><p>據了解起火的是一個儲有木材的貨倉，現場所見火警發生後，黑煙沖天。消防一度動用2條喉及2兩隊煙帽隊灌救，但其後再多派2隊煙帽隊，以及再動用多2條喉救火。據報至下午3時許，火勢已經受控。消防處呼籲，如市民受到隨風飄散的煙霧和異味影響，可關閉門窗並保持鎮定。</p><img alt=\"鳳降村一貨倉發生三級火。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cefd7010e60ee2daaae94eceef2acb15/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-17_at_14_53_10.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防進行撲救。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fbb64b616a606c44c7cdac21f0a8651e/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-17_at_14_53_09.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/df5f6f775ab27fb3c80f55f10f3b12c6/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-17_at_14_53_08.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"火警現場濃煙沖天。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c80101485163782d3f5e1a241b378400/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-17_at_14_53_07_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6e89455655a21a8518bbdadd17f5c3ba/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-17_at_14_52_41_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9d162f12d6240104501512ac802a02b1/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-17_at_14_52_39_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/65f1eaa5fdb7a12f6e5a67d3feff2461/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-17_at_14_52_39.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"人員出動機械人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/643bcf7dfd48c3644a52040161f429f2/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-17_at_15_16_00.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3642b9cdb24cb8778c7e62847d8164b6/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-17_at_15_15_59.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"亦派出無人機。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d9d8085309eef58e57da593d7f45a451/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-17_at_15_21_59.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-17T07:39:54.567989+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":323,"images":15,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}